    "rules": [
      {
        "rule": "base",
        "at": "base",
        "reason": "One item of a sidebar or top bar, its description says: a destination, a link where it has an `href` and a button otherwise, the current one selected (`aria-current=\"page\"`). MUI's ButtonBase on the web, for its keyboard focus (focus-visible) and its link or button element; its icon and label drawn with the shared layer helpers. Bespoke in Flutter, drawn and pressable. Collapsed, it is its icon alone, named by its label."
      },
      {
        "rule": "follows",
